<title>SWEDEN: SKF says currencies hit 9 month sales.</title>
<headline>SKF says currencies hit 9 month sales.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bearing manufacturer SKF posted on Thursday a nine-month profit after financial items of 1.85 billion crowns, saying currency effects had hit sales and operating profits in the first three quarters of the year.</p>
</text>
